WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.367
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.767
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:05.100
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.601
While speaking to reporters
last week

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.434
about the ongoing investigation

00:00:09.434 --> 00:00:11.767
into classified documents
found at his home,

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.367
President Biden defended
his handling of the files

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:17.734
that had been discovered and
said he has "no regrets."

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:20.000
Well, technically,
he didn't say it.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:26.334
President Biden's attorney
announced on Saturday

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:28.701
that FBI agents found six more
classified documents

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:30.534
during a search
of his Delaware home.

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:33.501
Oh, my God, how long
is this gonna go on?

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:36.434
I don't have that many
un-classified documents

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:39.167
in my house.
And how big is Biden's house?

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.133
Every day, there's a new update,
like, "Oops,

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:44.133
just found some
in the guest library."

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:46.133
[ Laughter ]
Also, you know they're onto you.

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:48.200
Why wouldn't you get everything
all gathered up?

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.767
When you were in college, and
the cops knocked on your door,

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:53.167
did you just flush
some of the weed?

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.501
I don't get it.
Do all politicians do this?

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:59.367
Is that why Jimmy Carter
is still building houses?

00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:01.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:03.901
Just to store
all his classified documents?

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:07.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.267
I think they're worried
I'm gonna do my Carter.

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:12.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.901 --> 00:01:15.767
Former Secretary of State
Mike Pompeo's new memoir

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:18.234
is set to be released this week,
and just to save time,

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:20.501
the title of the book
is "80 Percent Off."

00:01:20.501 --> 00:01:23.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:27.601
"Oh, don't look
in these new houses."

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:32.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.767
The Senate was set to reconvene
this afternoon at 3:00

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:36.067
after a 20-day break because

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:38.467
nothing says
"Let's get down to business"

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:41.067
like starting work
at 3:00 on a Monday.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.934
Three men in California
were recently arrested

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:47.534
for attempting to rob
a cannabis dispensary

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:50.100
after they led police
on a high-speed chase

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.734
and crashed into a solar panel.

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:55.534
Man, that sounds
like you asked your grandpa

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:58.300
to make up a news story
about California.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:02.067
A horse in Australia

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:04.300
was recently spotted
in the back seat of a car

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.000
entering a McDonald's
drive-through,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.968
but not leaving.

00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:11.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.968
So I can't tell.
Yea on that joke or neigh?

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:21.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:26.567
Pretty good restraint.

00:02:26.567 --> 00:02:29.067
Mike Scollins wrote that joke,
and we were very worried

00:02:29.067 --> 00:02:32.167
that the burger was gonna have,
like, a mane.

00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:35.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.234
Authorities in Rhode Island
recently agreed

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:39.267
to a child's request
to DNA-test

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:42.067
leftover Christmas cookies
for evidence of Santa Claus.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:44.367
And they're not gonna like
what they found out.

00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:48.467
Uh-oh, looks like Santa
murdered a guy in '96.

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:51.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.801 --> 00:02:55.133
Public health officials
in Massachusetts

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.467
have discovered
a new strain of gonorrhea

00:02:57.467 --> 00:03:00.334
that is resistant
to most antibiotics.

00:03:00.334 --> 00:03:04.467
Massachusetts, where even the
gonorrhea likes to fight stuff.

00:03:04.467 --> 00:03:05.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:08.133
"You think you're better
than me, penicillin?"

00:03:08.133 --> 00:03:10.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.601 --> 00:03:12.634
Finally, according to
the latest numbers,

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:16.000
"Avatar: The Way of Water"
has made $2 billion

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.100
at the global box office,
which is incredible.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.968
Only $1 billion more
for the movie to break even.

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:24.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:26.133
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

